<title>USA: Zions Bancorp declares 4-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Zions Bancorp declares 4-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zions Bancorp on late Friday announced a four-for-one split of its common stock, after its shareholders voted to increase the company's authorized shares to 100 million from 30 million.</p>
<p>The company said shareholders of record May 9 will receive three additional shares of Zions common stock on May 14 for each share owned.</p>
<p>The company said it currently has about 14.5 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
